{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05400","headline":"长歌行 · 李泌","name":"长歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天覆吾，地载吾，天地生吾有意无。\n不然绝粒昇天衢，不然鸣珂游帝都。\n焉能不贵复不去，空作昂藏一丈夫。\n一丈夫兮一丈夫，千生气志是良图。\n请君看取百年事，业就扁舟泛五湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}